# OS
.DS_Store

# AI Tool Symlinks: CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, .cursorrules, .claude/skills,
# .claude/agents, .claude/settings.json, .augment/* are all COMMITTED symlinks into
# .ai/ (source of truth). This repo has no package manager / postinstall step to
# auto-generate them, so committing the symlinks themselves is what guarantees
# Superpowers + repo hooks are active for every collaborator on every machine, from
# a plain `git clone` alone — no setup script required. Do NOT gitignore them.
# Only the personal, machine-specific files below are local-only:
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local-only personal files (copied into worktrees from main by setup-ai-symlinks.sh)
.ai/session-history/
